{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_08_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_08","title":"嘉維爾之拳","storyCode":"RI-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"4d71e8d92b577f013b1ede6944a88e515651b170e371200049f8323ac75b69fe","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"大醜倒下後，祖瑪瑪認輸，並將大酋長之位交給了嘉維爾。\n嘉維爾決定將這個位置轉交給特米米，但這反而讓她踏出了最後一步。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！哎，不對，下次我應該換個叫聲，有點膩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，他沒事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，等一會兒他就會回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，不過那真的是普通人嗎？我沒聽說有這樣的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，大祭司只說過他在這裡生活了很久很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，比起這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，真是個了不得的大傢伙啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你頭上在流血啊，沒事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，這點小傷，特米米，把我的醫療包拿過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？特米米這丫頭人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"給，你的醫療包。至於特米米，剛才快要贏的時候我好像看到她慌慌張張地往其他地方跑去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"謝了。她不會被嚇破膽了吧，算了，先包紮再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你們去看看有沒有受傷的傢伙，全部帶到我這來，我來給他們治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，交給我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，好麻煩啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"別抱怨啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大醜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪，抱歉啊，只能把它拆掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我檢查了一下，你的引擎還能用，我會把它還給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你不打算留下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我和你一樣，找到了要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"是醫生嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"做醫生很開心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"造機器很開心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，大酋長依然需要你來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，大醜倒下了是事實，你贏了，嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"看，人群重新聚集了起來，大家都在看著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，博士，怎麼辦啊。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"由你決定。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是跟沒說一樣嗎！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，別裝睡了！我可是醫生！"}]},{"label":"大酋長嘉維爾萬歲！","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，博士，我現在真想給你一拳。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？沒事。你跑哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？啊，那個，我剛才忽然想上廁所！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，嘉維爾，你怎麼忽然看著我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......哈哈，有了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都聽著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我戰勝了大醜，所以接下來由我來擔任大酋長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，我要對你們說的是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"拳頭，就是一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，嘉維爾，你要留下來做大酋長了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"但是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我有非常重要的事要去做，所以我還是要離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你們不用擔心！我不在的時候，會由特米米來代替我發號施令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"把特米米當成是我就行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒、誒誒誒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，這樣真的行得通嗎？這裡的人不是力量至上什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但嘉維爾是大酋長，她已經征服了所有人，所以她說的話當然是令人信服的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，祖瑪瑪，機器雖然很有意思，但是對我來說，果然還是拳頭更好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，別忘了，我並沒有承認你，我會造出更厲害的機器，然後再來挑戰你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，我等著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對了，在那之前，你得跟我走一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須先跟我去羅德島觀察一下你的礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以拒絕嗎，我還有大醜要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"這次可由不得你，而且在特米米就任前，我就是大酋長，就算是綁著你我也要帶你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘉維爾，你還是要走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，等把引擎拆下來裝回飛行器上，我就該走了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不准你走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉維爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["刻俄柏"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["宴"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
